06.webm?t=1742868032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284140/extras/63ef18e7df676233c0d2f90be6a40506.mp4?t=1742868032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284140/extras/d02ab1dc986cd59088bfb1443d7cf35f.avif?t=1742868032\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284140/extras/15bbe2d5173720658a1cd5a40fbc3d71.poster.avif?t=1742868032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284140/extras/15bbe2d5173720658a1cd5a40fbc3d71.webm?t=1742868032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284140/extras/15bbe2d5173720658a1cd5a40fbc3d71.mp4?t=1742868032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GREENFIELD is a story driven puzzle-platformer set in a lonely atmospheric world. Embark the surreal depths of a fractured mind and a forgotten island facility in search of answers to a haunting mystery.</strong><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>SURREAL VISUALS. Awe inspiring and unexpected imagery designed to captivate.<br></li><li>UNIQUE NARRATIVE DEVICE. Explore a fractured subconscious to unravel a compelling mystery, where memories are both symbolic and physical obstacles to traverse.<br></li><li>COLOSSAL BOSS BATTLES. Overcome towering mechanical creatures.<br></li><li>MYSTERIOUS AND ATMOSPHERIC WORLD. Explore unique biomes that center around a specific energy. Ranging from combustion, hydro, wind, photonic and magnetic.<br></li><li>UNIQUE ABILITIES. Acquire powerful abilities from strange technology.</li></ul>",
